WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.762
Review each promise in the fictional corrected offer.

00:00:03.762 --> 00:00:09.404
The provider can inspect the blank template, field instructions, example and checklist.

00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:17.398
A scenario check can find unclear instructions, but it cannot prove actual audience usefulness or income results.

00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:23.510
Use the approved AI request to organize the brief and flag unsupported claims.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.802
Compare the response with the supplied capacity.

00:00:26.802 --> 00:00:30.093
Reject invented support, buyer preference or guarantees.

00:00:30.093 --> 00:00:37.146
Retain the offer sentence, seven-area frame, inclusion and exclusion lists, user responsibility and format comparison.

00:00:37.146 --> 00:00:44.199
Record the chosen format, capacity check and open audience-test assumption in the same Project Record.

00:00:44.199 --> 00:00:50.312
Explain why a deliverable can be supplied while business success remains outside control.

00:00:50.312 --> 00:00:55.014
The saved draft is not publication approval or demand validation.

00:00:55.014 --> 00:00:59.716
Lesson Four Point Two will use this offer and scope.
